e genre (left to right): Jonathan Maberry, Daniel Kraus, Stefan Petrucha, Will Hill, Rachel Caine, Chase Novak, and Christopher Krovatin. Also present (but not visible in the photo) was Barry Lyga.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A10.13.12ZombiePanelByLuigiNovi1.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fc/Zombie_walk_Pittsburgh_29_Oct_2006.png/500px-Zombie_walk_Pittsburgh_29_Oct_2006.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fc/Zombie_walk_Pittsburgh_29_Oct_2006.png/500px-Zombie_walk_Pittsburgh_29_Oct_2006.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A zombie walk in Pittsburgh","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AZombie_walk_Pittsburgh_29_Oct_2006.png"}],"sounds":{"zombie":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/54/En-au-zombie.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/54/En-au-zombie.ogg/En-au-zombie.ogg.mp3"}]}}}